  "description": "QAVGIF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C73 H41 Er4 F54 N2 O30 Yb1. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 10 O neighbors; Er1 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er1A (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er2A (Er) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.559-3.884 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.41-111.12°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C73H41Er4F54N2O30Yb.",
